WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.190
While we're going through
this rough time together,

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:03.280
I thought I'd give you some tips

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:04.880
on how to help your community.

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:07.950
(whimsical music)

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:09.080
And now it's time

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:11.463
for Conan's Good Neighbor Tips.

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:15.900
Today's tip: donate items you're not using

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:17.490
to neighbors in need.

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:18.810
I'm gonna give away some great stuff

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:21.470
to my neighbors right now over Zoom.

00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:22.470
Hey, neighbors!

00:00:22.470 --> 00:00:24.340
Hey, Conan!
Hi, Conan!

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:25.360
I just went through the house

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:27.710
and found some really
nice things I'm not using.

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:29.420
I thought I'd give 'em away to you,

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:30.792
does that sound good?

00:00:30.792 --> 00:00:32.100
Great!
Nice.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:36.530
First off, Cathy, I had this
box of never-used VHS tapes.

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:38.210
Yeah, they're fantastic.

00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:39.660
I'm sending 'em your way.

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:41.150
Wow, no thank you, Conan.

00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:44.680
Chris, I have two packs of these Peeps.

00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:47.120
They're almost within the expiration date.

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:48.240
I'll deliver 'em to ya.

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:49.073
Please don't.

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:52.550
Hey, Ronnie, this made me think of you,

00:00:52.550 --> 00:00:54.290
it's a Freddy Krueger doll.

00:00:54.290 --> 00:00:56.382
I remember you said you saw that movie.

00:00:56.382 --> 00:00:57.700
That wasn't me, Conan.

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:59.970
Conan, did you just do a
bunch of spring cleaning

00:00:59.970 --> 00:01:02.570
and now you're trying to
pawn your junk off on us?

00:01:02.570 --> 00:01:05.050
No, Diane, and that's insulting.

00:01:05.050 --> 00:01:07.312
Now, do you want this
old toilet seat or not?

00:01:07.312 --> 00:01:09.150
(seat clacks)

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:11.720
Conan, this was a nice thought.

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:14.560
Maybe you should donate
stuff people actually want?

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:17.090
Anyway, State Farm wants to thank you

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:19.220
and all those good
neighbors across the country

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:20.140
helping each other.

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:21.040
Thanks, Jake.

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:24.050
Hey, I forgot, I have
something for you too.

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:27.186
Get your branded-messaging
out of my sketch,

00:01:27.186 --> 00:01:29.120
Jake from State Farm.

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:32.093
This has been Conan's Good Neighbor Tips.

